G ASA is a public limited company (allmennaksjeselskap) registered under andre tjenester tilknyttet sjøtransport (NACE 52.220), based in Bærum, founded 2010-02-25.","fact_ids":"e41e7b5a93e5dd385257182f|ec7c72258dcb0fae76b365bc|8df3c6aacac1db79d11b9440|1aabe858ce6ee9674063e002|c28a1aba571206d5f694760c"},{"position":1,"kind":"what_it_does","text":"Its verified website describes it as: “Our vision is to shape the maritime industry. Through innovation, expertise, quality products and services we are able to meet the challenges and needs of the world's global fleet.” Public brand: Wilhelmsen.","fact_ids":"65689fd50e1ebf34c4757531|19efb123433da34cf79a7f48"},{"position":2,"kind":"what_it_does","text":"Registered activity: Drive skipsfart, maritim servicevirksomhet, luftfart, industri, handel, finansvirksomhet, megling, agenturer og spedisjon, å eie eller drive fast eiendom, samt drive virksomhet beslektet med eller tilknyttet det nevnte. Dette kan skje direkte, eller indirekte ved garanti, aksjete.","fact_ids":"9c9e50eeb022f5f6adf3a26b"},{"position":3,"kind":"financials","text":"Latest filed accounts (2025-01-01 to 2025-12-31, company accounts): revenue NOK 25.2 m, operating result NOK -165.4 m, net result NOK 4.3 bn, total assets NOK 14.2 bn, equity NOK 12.6 bn. The period closed with a profit.","fact_ids":"3cecdd5b0d6476a6845ad040|2e434b96a04e97ccae4d128a|9e4d8d971ed29fa14d213055|76946eab9785ae66f82d627e|224352eebc0b6e8c55575b6a"},{"position":4,"kind":"financial_change","text":"Change from 2024 to 2025: revenue went from NOK 29.0 m to NOK 25.2 m (-13%); net result went from NOK 3.3 bn to NOK 4.3 bn (+28%); equity went from NOK 9.8 bn to NOK 12.6 bn (+28%).","fact_ids":"3cecdd5b0d6476a6845ad040|0a5c994db288e5421684c70e|9e4d8d971ed29fa14d213055|68990cb4f6da5001d7946efe|224352eebc0b6e8c55575b6a|6bfed67ce766a8c1daac0b3d"},{"position":5,"kind":"financial_health","text":"Financial position in 2025: operating margin -656.9%; equity ratio 88.7%. Calculated from the filed figures